PART10 — JOINS = Most Important Revision
"JOIN is not something you memorize using Venn diagrams. JOIN is a relationship problem"

Exampleki: customers
          customer_id
          name

        orders
          order_id
          customer_id
          amount
"Give me customer names and their orders" 
  Where is customer name? - customers
Where is order information? - orders & What connects them? - customer_id

SELECT c.name, o.order_id, o.amount
FROM customers c
JOIN orders o
ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id;

-- JOINki oka Mental Model
INNER JOIN: Give me matching records from both tables
LEFT JOIN: Give me everything from the left table, and matching data from the right if available(Give me all customers, including customers who never placed an order)

